<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-icon">🛒</view>
    <view><view class="hero-title">一键发起团购</view><view class="hero-sub">菜品信息已自动带入，分享给群里就能统计</view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card dish-card">
    <view class="dish-icon">🍜</view>
    <view class="dish-info"><view class="dish-name">{{dishName}}</view><view class="muted">{{storeName}}</view></view>
    <view class="price">¥{{price}} / {{unit}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card form">
    <view class="section-title">团购信息</view>
    <view class="label">团购名称</view>
    <input value="{{title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：周五牛肉面团" maxlength="80" />
    <view class="label">截止时间</view>
    <view class="datetime">
      <picker mode="date" value="{{endDate}}" bindchange="pickDate"><view class="picker">{{endDate}}</view></picker>
      <picker mode="time" value="{{endTime}}" bindchange="pickTime"><view class="picker">{{endTime}}</view></picker>
    </view>
    <view class="tips">发起后，大家打开团购页填写自己的购买数量，系统会自动汇总人数、总份数和预计金额。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="primary create-btn" loading="{{creating}}" disabled="{{creating}}" bindtap="create">{{creating?'正在创建…':'创建团购并进入团购页'}}</button>
  <view class="safe-tip">仅用于统计购买数量，不涉及线上支付、收款或配送</view>
</view>